      "writtenOn": "2017-10-11T16:30:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t fully understand when this code is executed,\nthe idle code is running interrupt disabled, then calling reset_rtc_alarm() before re-enabling them.\nIs something still pending when the interrupts are back ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 298,
        "startChar": 0,
